flowchart TD
  Human[Human explicit preferences] --> CLI[src.app JSON CLI]
  CLI --> Validate[Validate fields types and bounds]
  CSV[20 synthetic catalog records] --> Loader[Validate catalog]
  Loader --> Coverage[Check requested labels]
  Validate --> Coverage
  Coverage --> Plan[Record scoring plan]
  Plan --> Rank[Original weighted ranker with artist penalty]
  Rank --> Audit[Audit IDs records scores and explanations]
  Audit --> Filter[Minimum-support filter]
  Filter --> Output[Supported results and decision trace]
  Validate --> Refuse[Refuse without results]
  Coverage --> Refuse
  Audit --> Refuse
  Filter --> Refuse
  Reviewer[Human reviews suitability] -. checks .-> Output
  Evaluator[evaluate.py and 42 automated tests] -. verifies .-> Audit
